se-plug-ins-and-conne-wiwajoe4l","summary":"Announcement of the public preview of virtual network support for Power Platform Dataverse plug-ins and Connectors. This feature allows secure management of outbound connections and data integration within private networks.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/d99a718658cb87523340df34ae8bcc6b?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-03-21T03:00:48.000Z"},{"id":"cEZOSFWyr","title":"[Public Preview] Introducing the modern list for Power Pages","url":"https://powerpages.microsoft.com/en-us/blog/introducing-the-modern-list-public-preview-for-power-pages/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/public-preview-introducing-the-modern-list-for-power-pages-cezosfwyr","summary":"Power Pages introduces the modern list in public preview, offering a visually refreshed UX, better performance, and low/no code styling capability. The classic list is still supported.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/416593eb4d3fefa4b10a719f350d5b9e?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-03-19T08:37:00.000Z"},{"id":"FY44bsrW2","title":"Building your own copilot with Copilot Studio","url":"https://microsoftcopilotstudio.microsoft.com/en-us/blog/building-your-own-copilot-with-copilot-studio/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/building-your-own-copilot-with-copilot-studio-fy44bsrw2","summary":"Learn how to build your own copilot using Copilot Studio by customizing it for your specific business processes and workflows. Create intelligent chat experiences, connect with data sources, and publish to multiple channels.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/3705ce4796494d78eb4cf32cf42a1b7c?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-03-19T08:00:31.000Z"},{"id":"Atom4jZaU","title":"Announcing General Availability of built-in Dataverse offline for canvas apps","url":"https://powerapps.microsoft.com/en-us/blog/announcing-general-availability-of-built-in-dataverse-offline-for-canvas-apps/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/announcing-general-availability-of-built-in-dataverse-offline-for-canvas-apps-atom4jzau","summary":"Announcement of the general availability of built-in Dataverse offline for canvas apps. Canvas offline apps can work with Dataverse data without network connection, improving user experience and performance. The feature supports offline-first approach and provides out-of-the-box support for Dataverse files and images. Limitations include no support for non-Dataverse connectors and the app must be in a solution.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/4313ae56579726dbab91556f84ba7dd2?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-03-19T03:11:32.000Z"},{"id":"9NZGvAUkB","title":"On-premises data gateway March 2024 release","url":"https://powerbi.microsoft.com/en-us/blog/on-premises-data-gateway-march-2024-release/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/on-premises-data-gateway-march-2024-release-9nzgvaukb","summary":"The March 2024 release of the on-premises data gateway brings Power BI Desktop compatibility. It also introduces Azure Service Principal (SPN) support for on-premises and VNET data gateways.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/4f9d8c03adbb879e7b8c8c4780ca45c6?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-03-18T16:18:18.000Z"},{"id":"GVAz4xYBe","title":"Pipelines for All Public Preview: Easily set up pipelines in Power Platform","url":"https://powerapps.microsoft.com/en-us/blog/pipelines-for-all-public-preview-easily-set-up-pipelines-in-power-platform/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/pipelines-for-all-public-preview-easily-set-up-pipelines-in-power-platform-gvaz4xybe","summary":"Pipelines for All is a new streamlined process for setting up pipelines in Power Platform. Makers can create pipelines in environments that are not already associated with a custom host, enabling them to deploy solutions quickly and easily. Admins can still set up pipelines the traditional way and enable extensibility. The feature will be available next month.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--qPvKM23u--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2009","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-03-18T08:00:01.000Z"},{"id":"njkr88pxC","title":"Copilot Updates March 2024","url":"https://powerbi.microsoft.com/en-us/blog/copilot-updates-march-2024/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/copilot-updates-march-2024-njkr88pxc","summary":"This month's Copilot updates include support for Apps, improvements to Geography support, availability of Usage and Billing, and upcoming updates to Copilot Abuse monitoring.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/4f9d8c03adbb879e7b8c8c4780ca45c6?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-03-18T07:00:38.000Z"},{"id":"dMZ1HIsQo","title":"March 2024 update of Power Automate for desktop","url":"https://powerautomate.microsoft.com/en-us/blog/march-2024-update-of-power-automate-for-desktop/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/march-2024-update-of-power-automate-for-desktop-dmz1hisqo","summary":"The March 2024 update of Power Automate for desktop introduces new features such as a revamped variable picker, a new function picker, IntelliSense capabilities, support for minimum execution logs, and the 'Clear cells in Excel worksheet' action.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/209be153dffbb0dbe78c0ec2cf994c42?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-03-15T08:18:00.000Z"},{"id":"JFZtmehJ7","title":"Introducing inline actions","url":"https://powerapps.microsoft.com/en-us/blog/introducing-inline-actions/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/introducing-inline-actions-jfztmehj7","summary":"Introducing inline actions for Power Apps canvas apps allows for performing common authoring tasks directly on the canvas, reducing cognitive load and mouse travel. Copilot can also provide assistance in the new inline action bar.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-03-14T09:57:38.000Z"},{"id":"NQFQe6gmu","title":"Important update coming to Power BI Premium licensing","url":"https://powerbi.microsoft.com/en-us/blog/important-update-coming-to-power-bi-premium-licensing/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/important-update-coming-to-power-bi-premium-licensing-nqfqe6gmu","summary":"Microsoft is retiring Power BI Premium per capacity SKUs and customers are advised to transition to Microsoft Fabric capacity for additional benefits, such as more flexible SKU size, pay-as-you-go billing options, and access to Azure-only features.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/db6130f03b05cf7fb07b2cab4b4270a3?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-03-14T06:55:49.000Z"}],"similar_handles":["castai","echojs","lhn","manticoresearch","pointersgonewild"],"opposite_handles":["dailydevworld","horde","on_leuwcq","watercooler","dotnetsquad"],"similar":[{"id":"castai","handle":"castai","name":"Cast AI","is_squad":false,"x":-0.5899,"y":-3.0496,"cluster_id":3,"posts_collected":110,"image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/t_logo,f_auto/v1/logos/e5868702aaf84d8293e56794e2c6629c","features_preview":{"posts_per_week":0.788148,"median_upvotes":0.0,"author_present_share":0.0,"hype_score":0.004545,"avg_read_time":6.645455,"tag_diversity":0.427273},"top_tags_preview":[["kubernetes",89],["cloud",52],["devops",45]],"view_coords":{"engagement_style":[0.8676,-0.4706],"cadence_depth":[0.4118,1.7059],"hype_variety":[-1.8382,-3.8088],"title_style":[2.7353,6.3529]}},{"id":"echojs","handle":"echojs","name":"Echo JS","is_squad":false